## ==========================================
## V-Closet Enterprise .NET Gitignore Template
## ==========================================

# 1. Block .NET Build, Output, and Publish Folders
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Pp]ublish/
**/[Oo]ut/
TestResults/

# 2. Block IDE Configurations
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.ide/

# 3. Block Local Secrets (CRITICAL)
.env

# 4. Block OS & Cache Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
